      "displayDate": "Jan 14, 1977 • 9:30 PM",
      "content": "Tough game tonight, but we pulled through against Morley-Stanwood! Scoring 18 points felt great, but it was really a team effort to out-rebound them 66-32. This win keeps us right in the hunt for second place in the conference.",
      "person_id": "p_brian_layer",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2030.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_002",
