      "author": "Jason Johnson",
      "handle": "@jason_j",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-14T22:15:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 14, 1977 • 10:15 PM",
      "content": "Double-double tonight! Finished with 10 points and 11 rebounds against Morley-Stanwood. Feeling really locked in on the boards lately. Let's keep this momentum going into the Hesperia game.",
      "person_id": "p_jason_johnson",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2030.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_003",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Doug Weston",
      "handle": "@d_weston",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-14T19:50:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 14, 1977 • 7:50 PM",
      "content": "That basket right at the buzzer to end the half was huge. Going into the locker room up 42-31 gave us all the confidence we needed to finish them off in the second half.",
      "person_id": "p_doug_weston",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2030.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_004",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Brian Layer",
      "handle": "@b_layer",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-11T21:00:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 11, 1977 • 9:00 PM",
      "content": "Another big night! Dropped 21 points on Hesperia tonight to lead us to a 56-43 win. We've officially moved into second place! It's a great feeling to see the hard work paying off in the standings.",
      "person_id": "p_brian_layer",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2030.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_005",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Coach Sarachman",
      "handle": "@eagle_coach",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-11T22:30:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 11, 1977 • 10:30 PM",
      "content": "Our defense wasn't bad until the third quarter, but our offense was kind of sluggish and never really got going. We're glad for the win, but we have work to do on our consistency if we want to stay at the top.",
      "person_id": "p_coach_sarachman",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2030.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_006",
