      "displayDate": "Jan 19, 1977 • 12:15 PM",
      "content": "The White House is definitely a place of rare beauty and I'm sure it has many caretakers, but I wouldn't want to live there for a year. It's just not homey enough for me.",
      "person_id": "p_jill_long",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2030.pdf"
    },
